cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Migration and population data archive, 40 countries, 2010-2022"
message: >-
  If you use this archive, please cite the accompanying study and state the
  archive freeze date, 2026-08-17. The archive is joint work of Prof. Raymond
  Kuo (郭年真), National Taiwan University, and Claude (Anthropic).
type: dataset
version: "2026-08-18"
date-released: 2026-08-18

authors:
  - family-names: "Kuo"
    given-names: "Raymond N."
    alias: "郭年真"
    affiliation: "Institute of Health Policy and Management, National Taiwan University"
    website: "https://raymond.cph.ntu.edu.tw/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/raymondkuo/migration-healthcare-attitudes-evidence"
license: "NOASSERTION"

abstract: >-
  Source archive and verification record for a country-year panel of population,
  foreign-born population, foreign-national population and irregular-migration
  indicators covering 40 countries for 2010-2022. Every value is traced to a
  source file held in the archive: statistical-agency API responses are stored as
  raw payloads, and web-page sources are stored as HTML, PDF mirrors and full-page
  screenshots. Of 2,454 values re-derived from live sources on 2026-08-17, 2,415
  reproduced exactly; the 39 discrepancies were corrected and re-verified against
  the live source on 2026-08-18, when all 21 sources reproduced at 100%. In total
  2,737 value-by-value comparisons are recorded, and 50 values were corrected,
  each itemised with its evidence.

keywords:
  - migration
  - foreign nationals
  - foreign-born population
  - irregular migration
  - public healthcare
  - panel data
  - data verification
  - replication archive
